# Minimal muse-gateway setup. Uncomment only what you need; keep real keys private.
# Server, doctor, --models and launch share --env-file PATH.
# CLI > current environment (even blank) > file. No file is created automatically.
# MUSE_SHIM_* and removed settings only produce migration diagnostics.

# Normal launch uses your `muse login` subscription. Do not set META_API_KEY
# for launch: it is an explicit API-billing choice and conflicts with subscription.
# Codex uses `codex login` / CODEX_HOME/auth.json; Claude uses signed-in `claude`.
# Devin uses `devin auth login`. No credential databases or saved selections.

# Listener, timeout and diagnostics (log defaults to the current directory).
# MUSE_GATEWAY_PORT=8787
# MUSE_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT=600
# MUSE_GATEWAY_LOG_FILE=/path/to/muse-gateway.log
# Capture is OFF by default and CLI-only: pass --capture-dir /private/path.
# Captures contain conversation content; no env/file setting enables them.

# Optional menu filter: exact provider/model IDs, never entitlement or new rows.
# Unset/blank lists all available models, preserving backend/default ordering.
# MUSE_GATEWAY_MODELS=meta/muse-spark-1.3,codex/gpt-5.6-sol

# Local route: unset upstream disables it. Requires Responses, not just Chat.
# Its key is optional. Unset key sends NO Authorization header, never Muse's key.
# Models need positive context/output metadata to appear in the numeric menu.
# MUSE_GATEWAY_LOCAL_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:4000/v1
# MUSE_GATEWAY_LOCAL_API_KEY=replace-with-your-upstream-key

# Claude transport: cli (default) or http (direct Anthropic Messages).
# MUSE_GATEWAY_CLAUDE_TRANSPORT=cli
# Which Claude credentials the `claude -p` child may inherit (default oauth):
# MUSE_GATEWAY_CLAUDE_CLI_PASSTHROUGH=oauth
# Claude credential locations honored by discovery: CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR,
# CLAUDE_CODE_CREDENTIALS_PATH (beside CODEX_HOME for Codex).
# Standard Claude HTTP credentials: CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN,
# CLAUDE_CODE_REFRESH_TOKEN, or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY. Prefer normal CLI login.
# Optional explicit Devin token: standard DEVIN_API_KEY (else CLI login).

# Optional separate Kiro Gateway: its PROXY_API_KEY, NOT native Kiro credentials.
# Configure a FREE gateway listener port, for example --port 8791.
# MUSE_GATEWAY_KIRO_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
# MUSE_GATEWAY_KIRO_API_KEY=replace-with-your-kiro-gateway-proxy-key
# Autostart is OFF by default and CLI-only: --kiro-autostart
# --kiro-server-dir ~/kiro-gateway. Existing services are never restarted.

# Advanced operations are CLI-only: --host, --provider, --model,
# --no-model-discovery, --portable, --max-body-bytes, --insecure-upstream,
# --verbose, --codex-auth-path, --claude-credentials, --claude-cli,
# native --*-upstream / --*-token-url (guarded), and --devin-upstream.
# No global output cap, provider model-list overrides, or budget environment.
